    "profile_rule": "Require finite strictly positive high and low with low<=high at every selected clock. Retain high=low as q=0. Require finite Q>0 and divide every q by Q.",
    "market_benchmark_rule": "Accumulate only complete finite normalized profiles by date and clock in deterministic sorted-symbol order; store float64 sums and integer counts; remove the candidate profile and one count exactly before the peer mean.",
